@startuml
title Figure 5.4: Sequence Diagram of the Test Execution (component level).
participant "Vue\n(Execute.vue)" as Vue
participant "Rust Core\n(execution.rs)" as Rust
participant "pytest" as Py
database "SQLite\n(history tables)" as DB

Vue -> Rust: run_tests(projectId, path, interpreter, testCases, pytestArgs, suiteId?)
Rust -> Py: spawn pytest -v --junitxml (xunit1)
activate Py
loop running
    Py --> Rust: stdout / stderr lines
    Rust --> Vue: event test-output
end
alt cancel
    Vue -> Rust: cancel_run(runId)
    Rust -> Py: SIGTERM -> 2s -> SIGKILL
end
Py --> Rust: exit code + JUnit XML
deactivate Py
Rust -> Rust: parse JUnit XML
Rust --> Vue: event test-finished
Rust -> DB: save execution history + result details
@enduml
